  <revision rev="8" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>a563d8a687a9840c2cc2a7b80409b0b8</srcmd5>
    <version>3.0.1</version>
    <time>1795619641</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to 3.0.1:
  * Fix shell completion crash with Click 8+.
- Changes from 3.0.0:
  * Drop Python 3.10 support (minimal version is now 3.11).
  * Switch build system to hatchling / pyproject.toml.
  * Set a 30-second timeout for backend synchronization
    requests.
  * Read Watson version from installed package metadata.
  * Fix wrong local time offset for dates in a different DST
    period than now (arrow 1.4+).
  * Fix Bash and Zsh completions broken since Click 8.
  * Command examples in help messages being re-wrapped by
    Click.
- Switch to pyproject macros
- Use %define pythons %{primary_python}.
- Add %check section running %pytest.
- Drop obsolete distutils macro and Group tags.</comment>
    <requestid>1400508</requestid>
  </revision>
